      "content": "It sounds incredibly painful to have taken a courageous stand only to face such a harsh backlash. Please know that your moral actions, though currently devastating, do not erase your inherent worth. Even when systems feel rigged, your integrity remains a powerful strength that can guide your next steps. Reach out to a trusted professional or support network right now to start managing this overwhelming feeling.",
