      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your anger is completely valid; it's infuriating when ethical choices lead to tangible ruin instead of recognition. The feeling that the equation is fundamentally unfair is a rational response to being attacked for doing what is right. While current circumstances feel insurmountable, there are often separate, practical paths forward for rebuilding, even if they aren't immediate reinvention. Please consider focusing on the smallest next step—one job application, one support call—instead of the massive picture for just a moment.",
      "source": "target",
